ets, stabilizing crude prices and improving investor sentiment in Petronet LNG.","summary":"Petronet LNG shares surged 9.1% amid hopes of a US-Iran ceasefire, trading at ₹278.39 on NSE.\nThe geopolitical deal boosted energy markets, stabilizing crude prices and improving investor sentiment in Petronet LNG.","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/petronet-lng-share-price-rises-9-on-bourses-amid-iran-us-ceasefire-hopes-126040800209_1.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-08T09:32:19","source":"Business Standard"},{"id":"260404187675584","title":"Petronet's Dahej LNG terminal faces low utilisation due to West Asia war cutting imports by half.\nIndia's LNG facilities see lowest utilisation in years, per oil ministry and industry data.","summary":"Petronet's Dahej LNG terminal faces low utilisation due to West Asia war cutting imports by half.\nIndia's LNG facilities see lowest utilisation in years, per oil ministry and industry data.","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/economy/news/costly-lng-terminals-in-india-hit-by-low-utilisation-amid-supply-shock-126040400268_1.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-04T12:57:15","source":"Business Standard"},{"id":"553576","title":"Nomura warns OMCs like IOCL, BPCL, and HPCL face margin pressure from ATF, LPG price hikes, and subsidy burdens.\nPetronet LNG expands capacity to 22.5 mtpa; RIL's SEZ refinery exempted from windfall tax, aiding margins.","summary":"Nomura warns OMCs like IOCL, BPCL, and HPCL face margin pressure from ATF, LPG price hikes, and subsidy burdens.\nPetronet LNG expands capacity to 22.5 mtpa; RIL's SEZ refinery exempted from windfall tax, aiding margins.","url":"https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/atf-lpg-price-hikes-to-pressure-omc-margins-iocl-bpcl-hpcl-hit-nomura-126040200196_1.html","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-04-02T09:24:23","source":"Business Standard"},{"id":"551874","title":"Petronet LNG Ltd has commissioned expanded LNG regasification facilities, increasing Da