perations.\nPetronet LNG declared force majeure as upstream suppliers failed to deliver contracted LNG volumes.","summary":"LNG disruptions in the Strait of Hormuz halve India's urea output, impacting plants' operations.\nPetronet LNG declared force majeure as upstream suppliers failed to deliver contracted LNG volumes.","url":"https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/economy/agri-business/lng-disruption-halves-indias-urea-output-as-west-asia-tensions-deepen/article70771691.ece","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-22T12:26:03","source":"The Hindu BusinessLine"},{"id":"535081","title":"Petronet LNG's board approves wholly-owned subsidiary for energy innovations.\nThe subsidiary will focus on startup support and sustainable business initiatives.","summary":"Petronet LNG's board approves wholly-owned subsidiary for energy innovations.\nThe subsidiary will focus on startup support and sustainable business initiatives.","url":"","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-22T12:02:49","source":"Livesquawk"},{"id":"260320177732925","title":"FirstCry, GMDC, and Petronet LNG emerge as key movers on Friday.\nThese stocks showed notable performance changes among 7 top movers.","summary":"FirstCry, GMDC, and Petronet LNG emerge as key movers on Friday.\nThese stocks showed notable performance changes among 7 top movers.","url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/gainers-amp-losers-firstcry-gmdc-and-petronet-lng-among-7-top-movers-on-friday/slideshow/129700435.cms","imageUrl":null,"pubDate":"2026-03-20T12:03:16","source":"The Economic Times"},{"id":"532952","title":"Nomura cuts Petronet LNG's price target to ₹340 from ₹370, maintaining a 'buy' rating.\nWest Asia crisis impacts near-term volumes; FY27 EBITDA cut by 23%. Stock trades at ₹271.9, near 52-week low.","summary":"Nomura cuts Petronet LNG's price target to ₹340 from ₹370, maintaining a 'buy' rating.\nWest Asia crisis impacts near-term volumes; FY27 EBITDA cut by 23%. Stock trades at ₹271.9, near 52-week low.","u